<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2CO" style="id" />
  <para style="h">2 KORENT</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 WAA KORENT</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ñaareelu bataaxal bi Yàlla may Pool, <optbreak /> mu bind ko</para>
  <para style="mt1">WAA KORENT</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2CO 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 1:1" />Man Pool, ndawul Kirist Yeesu ci coobarey Yàlla, man ak Timote sunu mbokk, noo leen di bind, yéen mbooloom Yàlla mi nekk dëkku Korent, ak gaayi Yàlla yu sell, yi nekk ci diiwaanu Akayi gépp. <verse eid="2CO 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 1:2" />Yal na leen Yàlla sunu Baay ak Boroom bi Yeesu Kirist may yiw ak jàmm.<verse eid="2CO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yàlla, Boroom lépp luy dëfal xol yi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 1:3" />Cant ñeel na Yàlla, Baayu sunu boroom Yeesu Kirist, di Baay biy Aji Yërëm tey Boroom lépp luy dëfal xol yi. <verse eid="2CO 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 1:4" />Mooy dëfal sunu xol ci sunu tiis yépp, ngir nun ci sunu bopp nu mana dëfal xolu ñépp ñi nekk ci tiis, di leen sédd ci noflaay, bi Yàlla def ci sunu xol. <verse eid="2CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 1:5" />Ndaxte ni coonoy Kirist di baawaane ci nun, noonu it la Kirist nekke buntu noflaay bu yaa, biy dëfal sunu xol. <verse eid="2CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 1:6" />Su nuy jaar ci tiis, seen noflaay a tax ak seen mucc. Bu dee Yàlla dëfal na sunu xol, seen noflaay a tax, ngir ngeen mana dékku naqar yu mel ni yu nuy am, nun itam. <verse eid="2CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 1:7" />Sunu yaakaar ci seen mbir dëgër na, xam ne ni ngeen bokke ak nun naqar, noonu ngeen di bokke ak nun noflaayu xol.<verse eid="2CO 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 1:8" />Ndaxte bokk yi, bëggunu ngeen umple tiis, wi nu daj ci diiwaanu Asi. Yen bi diisoon na lool ba weesu sunu kàttan, ba amatunu yaakaar sax ci dund. <verse eid="2CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 1:9" />Demoon nanu ba defe ne dogalees na sunug dee. Loolu amoon na, ngir nu baña wéer sunu yaakaar ci sunu bopp, waaye nu wéer ko ci Yàlla, miy dekkal néew yi. <verse eid="2CO 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 1:10" />Moo nu musal ci dee gu metti googu te dina nu musalaat. Ci moom lanu wékk sunu yaakaar ne dina nu musalati, <verse eid="2CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 1:11" />bu ngeen nu jàpplee di ci boole seeni ñaan. Noonu ñu bare dinañu gërëm Yàlla ci yiw, wi mu nu may te muy tontul ñaanu ñu bare.<verse eid="2CO 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pool setal na boppam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 1:12" />Li nuy tiitaroo moo di sunu xel day seede ne ci kanam àddina si, rawatina sax ci seen kanam, aw nanu ci tànk yu jub, ànd ak xol bu laab fa kanam Yàlla. Jëfewunu ci pexem nit, waaye ci yiwu Yàlla lanu jëfe. <verse eid="2CO 1:12" /><verse number="13-14" style="v" sid="2CO 1:13-14" />Bindunu leen nag leneen lu dul li ngeen jàng te xam ko. Fi mu ne seen xam-xam ci nun matagul, waaye yaakaar naa ne bu matee, dingeen mana tiitaru ci nun, ni nu koy defe ci yéen, bu bésu Boroom bi Yeesu ñëwee.<verse eid="2CO 1:13-14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 1:15" />Kon ni ma ame woon kóolute googu, naroon naa jëkka jaar ci yéen, ngir ganesi leen ñaari yoon. <verse eid="2CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 1:16" />Bëggoon naa jaar ci yéen, dem diiwaanu Maseduwan, te bu ma jógee Maseduwan, dikkaat ci yéen, ngir ngeen waajal sama tukki ca Yude. <verse eid="2CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 1:17" />Ba may mébét loolu nag, ndax dama cee boolewul pastéef? Te ndax samay yéene yéeney nit kese la, ba may xel ñaar, naan «waaw» ak «déet»?<verse eid="2CO 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 1:18" />Wóor na Yàlla ne li nu leen di wax, du «waaw» ju ànd ak «déedéet». <verse eid="2CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 1:19" />Ndaxte Doomu Yàlla ji, Yeesu Kirist, mi nu doon yégle ci seen biir, man ak Silwan ak Timote, nekkul woon «waaw» ak «déedéet;» «waawi» Yàlla la masa nekk. <verse eid="2CO 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 1:20" />Te lépp lu Yàlla dige woon fekk na «waawam» ci moom. Noonu kon ci Kirist lanuy waxe: «Amiin», ngir yékkati ndamu Yàlla. <verse eid="2CO 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 1:21" />Te Yàlla moo nuy dëgëral ci Kirist, nun ak yéen, te sol nu Xelam. <verse eid="2CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 1:22" />Moo nu màndargaal ni ay gaayam, def Xelam ci sunu xol, muy dawal ci cér, bi mu nu dencal.<verse eid="2CO 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 1:23" />Man nag Yàlla seede na ma, te giñ naa ci sama bakkan ne yërëm leen rekk moo tax délseeguma Korent. <verse eid="2CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 1:24" />Du caageen nag noo leen bëgga not ci lu jëm ci seen ngëm, waaye nu ngi liggéeyandoo ak yéen ngir seen mbég, ndaxte ci ngëm ngeen sax.<verse eid="2CO 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2CO 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 2:1" />Man nag fas yéene naa lii: duma délsi ci yéen ci naqar. <verse eid="2CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 2:2" />Ndaxte su ma leen tegee naqar, kuy seral sama xol ku dul yéen ñi ma teg aw naqar? <verse eid="2CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 2:3" />Looloo tax ma binde noonu, ngir baña agsi, am naqar ci ñi ma waroona bégal. Am naa kóolute ci yéen ñépp ne sama mbég mooy seen mbég. <verse eid="2CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 2:4" />Ci biir tiis ak xol bu jeex laa leen bind, samay bët taa ak ay rongooñ. Binduma leen ngir teg leen naqar, waaye ngir ngeen xam xóotaayu mbëggeel gi ma am ci yéen.<verse eid="2CO 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pool baal na ki tooñoon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 2:5" />Su kenn tegee moroomam naqar, du man la ko teg, waaye man nanu ne yéen ñépp la ko teg --matul may réyal mbir mi. <verse eid="2CO 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 2:6" />Àtte bi ko mbooloo mi teg, doy na. <verse eid="2CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 2:7" />Léegi nag baal-leen ko te dëfal xolam, ngir bañ mu sóobu ci naqar wu ëpp. <verse eid="2CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 2:8" />Kon maa ngi leen di ñaan, ngeen feddali seen mbëggeel ci moom. <verse eid="2CO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 2:9" />Nattu leen moo tax ma bind leen it, ngir seet ba xam ndax dingeen dégg ndigal ci lépp. <verse eid="2CO 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 2:10" />Ku ngeen baal, ma baal ko itam. Man nag, su ma baalee --fekk am lu ma wara baale-- yéena tax ma def ko ci kanam Kirist, <verse eid="2CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 2:11" />ngir Seytaane baña am bunt bu mu jaar ba nax nu, ndaxte réerewunu mbir ay pexeem.<verse eid="2CO 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndawi Yàlla ci xamle kóllëre gu bees, gi Yàlla fas ak nit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 2:12" />Ba ma àggee Torowas nag, ngir yégle fa xibaaru jàmm bi ci Kirist, Boroom bi ubbil na ma ci bunt. <verse eid="2CO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 2:13" />Waaye sama xel dalul benn yoon, ndax li ma fa fekkul sama mbokk, Tit. Noonu nag ma tàggu leen, daldi dem diiwaanu Maseduwan.<verse eid="2CO 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 2:14" />Waaye cant ñeel na Yàlla! Ci sunu booloo ak Kirist, daf nuy yóbbaale saa su nekk ci gawari ndamam, tey jaar ci nun ngir turu Kirist jolli fu nekk, ni xetu latkoloñ di tasaaroo. <verse eid="2CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 2:15" />Ndaxte ci Yàlla, xetu Kirist gu neex lanu, di gilli jëm ci ñiy mucc ak ñiy sànku; <verse eid="2CO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 2:16" />ci ñu mujj ñii, xet gu sedd lanu, guy jëme ci dee; ci ñu jëkk ñi, xetu dund lanu, guy jëme ci dund. Ku mana àttan yen boobu! <verse eid="2CO 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 2:17" />Nun nag melunu ni ñu bare, ñiy baana-baana ci kàddug Yàlla, waaye ci sunu booloo ak Kirist, nu ngi waare ak xol bu laab fa kanam Yàlla, ni yonenti Yàlla.<verse eid="2CO 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2CO 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 3:1" />Mbaa du danoo tàmbalee tëgguwaat nag? Mbaa du danoo soxla ni ñenn ñi ay dénkaane yu ñu nuy gërëme, te ñuy bataaxal yu jóge ci yéen walla yu jëm ci yéen? <verse eid="2CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 3:2" />Déedéet, yéenay sunu bataaxal; ci sunu xol lañu ko bind, di bataaxal bu nit ñépp mana xam te jàng ko; <verse eid="2CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 3:3" />ndaxte leer na ne bataaxal bu jóge ci Kirist ngeen, bu mu jaarale ci nun. Bindeesu ko daa, waaye ci Xelum Yàlla miy dund lees ko binde; du ci àlluway doj lañu ko rëdd, waaye ci xolu doom Aadama.<verse eid="2CO 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 3:4" />Googu kóolute lanu am fa kanam Yàlla ndax Kirist. <verse eid="2CO 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 3:5" />Du caageen nag ne àttan nanu dara ci sunu man-man, ba nu yaakaar dara ci sunu bopp, waaye sunu kàttan ci Yàlla lay jóge. <verse eid="2CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 3:6" />Moo nu jox kàttan, nu nekk ndaw yuy xamle kóllëre gu bees gi. Kóllëre googu ajuwul ci ay sàrti diine, waaye mi ngi aju ci jëfu Xelum Yàlla. Ndaxte sàrti kese day jëme ci dee, waaye Xelum Yàlla dafay joxe dund.<verse eid="2CO 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndamu kóllëre gu bees gi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 3:7" />Ba ñu bindee arafi sàrt yi ciy àlluway doj, leeraayu ndamu Yàlla nekk fa. Xar kanamu Musaa di leer, ba bànni Israyil duñu ko mana xool, fekk leer ga di wéy. Ndegam sàrti yoon yooyuy jëme ci dee, ñoo ànd ak ndam, <verse eid="2CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 3:8" />rawatina nag ne jëfu Xelum Yàlla dina gëna ànd ak ndam. <verse eid="2CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 3:9" />Su fekkee ne tëralin, wiy teg nit tooñ, àndoon na ak ndam, rawatina ci tëralin wiy àtte nit jub. <verse eid="2CO 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 3:10" />Ndaxte ndam li amoon keroog suux na ci ndam li ko raw léegi. <verse eid="2CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 3:11" />Te it ndegam li wéy dafa amoon ndam, astamaak li fi sax.<verse eid="2CO 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 3:12" />Kon nag gannaaw wékku nanu ci yaakaar ju mel noonu, danuy waare ak kóolute gu mag. <verse eid="2CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 3:13" />Dunu def ni Musaa, mi daan muur xar kanamam, ngir bànni Israyil baña gis jeexug leer googu saxul. <verse eid="2CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 3:14" />Waaye seen xel dafa daldi gumba. Ba tey jii sax, bu ñuy jàng téereb kóllëre gu jëkk gi, muuraay googu dafay des; deñul, ndaxte ci Kirist rekk la mana deñe. <verse eid="2CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 3:15" />Waaw, ba tey jii, su ñuy jàng yoonu Musaa, seen xol dafay muuru. <verse eid="2CO 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 3:16" />Waaye saa su kenn walbatikoo ci Boroom bi, muuraay gi daldi muriku. <verse eid="2CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 3:17" />Fekk nag Boroom, bi ñuy wax foofu, moo di Xelum Yàlla, te fu Xelu Boroom bi nekk, foofa yaatu gu mat am na fa. <verse eid="2CO 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 3:18" />Nun ñépp nag, danuy lerxat ndamu Boroom bi ak xar kanam bu muuruwul, bay soppiku ci melokaanam, ànd ak ndam luy yokku te sax ci dooley Boroom biy Xelum Yàlla.<verse eid="2CO 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2CO 4" />
  <para style="s">Xibaaru Kirist leeral na sunu xol yi lëndëmoon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 4:1" />Kon nag ndegam Yàlla ci yërmandeem sas na nu liggéey boobu, dunu bayliku. <verse eid="2CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 4:2" />Lànk nanoo ànd ci mbir, yi ñuy nëbb te ñu gàccelu. Sunuy tànk du yu njublaŋ te dunu dëngal kàddug Yàlla. Waaye nu ngi biral dëgg, di sàkku kóoluteg ñépp fa kanam Yàlla. <verse eid="2CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 4:3" />Su fekkee ne sax, xibaaru jàmm bi dafa muuru ci ñenn ñi, dafa fekk ñoom ñu aw yoon wu jëm ci sànkute. <verse eid="2CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 4:4" />Ñoom la yàllay jamono ji gëlëmal seen xel, ngir ñu baña gis leeru xibaaru jàmm, biy wone ndamu Kirist, mi di melokaanu Yàlla. <verse eid="2CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 4:5" />Ndaxte Yeesu Kirist Boroom bi lanuy waare, waaye waarewunu lu jëm ci sunu bopp. Nun seeni jaam lanu ndax Yeesu. <verse eid="2CO 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 4:6" />Ndaxte Yàlla mi ne: «Na leer leer ci biir lëndëm,» moo leer ci sunu xol, ngir leeral nu ak xam-xamu ndamu Yàlla, liy feeñ ci xar kanamu Kirist.<verse eid="2CO 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Xibaaru Kirist dafa mel ni alal ju ñu yeb ciy njaq</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 4:7" />Leer googu ci sunu xol mi ngi mel ni alal, waaye ñu ngi ko def ci nun ñi néew doole niy njaq kese, ngir kàttan gu ëpp xel gi, bawoo ci Yàlla te du ci nun. <verse eid="2CO 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 4:8" />Dañu nuy sonal fu nekk, waaye kenn tancu nu. Dañu nuy dugal ci ruq yi, waaye dinanu ci génn. <verse eid="2CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 4:9" />Dañu nuy fitnaal, waaye Yàlla du nu wacc mukk. Tër nañu nu, waaye kenn doggaliwu nu. <verse eid="2CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 4:10" />Fu nu tollu noo ngi gàddu ci sunu yaram dee gi Yeesu dee woon, ngir dundu Yeesu moom it feeñ ci sunu yaram. <verse eid="2CO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 4:11" />Bés bu nekk, nun ñiy dund, ñu ngi nuy jébbal dee ndax Kirist, ngir dundu Kirist moom itam feeñ ci sunu yaram wiy dee. <verse eid="2CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 4:12" />Noonu dee mu ngi jëf ci nun, dund di jëf ci yéen.<verse eid="2CO 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 4:13" />Mbind mi nee na: «Damaa gëm, moo tax ma wax.» Nun it nag, ndegam am nanu menn xelu ngëm moomu, danoo gëm, ba tax nuy wax. <verse eid="2CO 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 4:14" />Ndaxte xam nanu ne Yàlla, mi dekkal Boroom bi Yeesu, dina nu dekkal nun itam ak Yeesu, te dina nu yóbbu ak yéen, taxawal nun ñépp ci jataayam. <verse eid="2CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 4:15" />Ndaxte lépp li nuy daj, seen njariñ a tax, ngir yiwu Yàlla, wiy yokku ci nit ñu gëna takku, yokkaale ngërëm lu jëm ci Yàlla, ngir jollil ndamam.<verse eid="2CO 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 4:16" />Loolu moo tax sunu yaakaar du tas. Bu fekkee sax sunu yaram day yàqu jëm cig mag, sunu ruu moom, bés ak bés muy gëna yeesaat. <verse eid="2CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 4:17" />Ndaxte sunu coono bu woyof bi dul yàgg, dafa nuy jural ndam lu bare, ba suul coono bi, tey sax abadan. <verse eid="2CO 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 4:18" />Kon diirunu li ñuy gis waaye li ñu dul gis. Ndaxte li ñuy gis day wéy, waaye li ñu dul gis day sax ba fàww.<verse eid="2CO 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2CO 5" />
  <para style="s">Sunu màkkaan ci wetu Boroom bi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 5:1" />Yaram wi nu soloo ci kaw suuf dafa mel ni ab xayma. Su daanoo, xam nanu ne Yàlla jagleel na nu am taax ci asamaan, mu loxol nit defarul, di taax muy sax ba fàww. <verse eid="2CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 5:2" />Fi mu ne nu ngi wonk, di yàkkamtee féete ak sunu dëkkukaayu asamaan, sol ko ni koddaay, xam ne <verse eid="2CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 5:3" />bu nu ko solee, dunu def yaramu neen. <verse eid="2CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 5:4" />Nun ñi nekk ci xayma bii, nu ngi wonk ndax coono. Du caageen ne danoo bëgga summi sunu yaramu àddina, waaye danoo bëgga sol sunu yaramu asamaan, ngir liy dee sóobu ci biir dund. <verse eid="2CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 5:5" />Ki nu waajal ngir loolu moo di Yàlla, moom mi nu jox Xelam, di dawal ci cér bi mu nu dencal.<verse eid="2CO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 5:6" />Noonu kon nu ngi fees ak kóolute fu nu tollu; te xam nanu ne fi ak nu ngi dëkk ci yaram wii, àggagunu sunu màkkaan ci wetu Boroom bi-- <verse eid="2CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 5:7" />ndaxte doxewunu ab gis, waaye ngëm lanuy doxe. <verse eid="2CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 5:8" />Kon fees nanu ak kóolute, te yéenee jóge ci dëkkukaayu yaram wii, dem dëkk ci wetu Boroom bi. <verse eid="2CO 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 5:9" />Kon nag des fi walla jóge fi, li nuy faaydaal moo di neex Boroom bi. <verse eid="2CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 5:10" />Ndaxte nun ñépp fàww nu teew ci kanam Kirist, mu àtte nu, ngir ku nekk jot peyu li mu def ci yaramam, muy lu baax walla lu bon.<verse eid="2CO 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nanguleena juboo ak Yàlla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 5:11" />Gannaaw xam nanu ragal Yàlla nag, nu ngi fexee gëmloo nit ñi, waaye li nu nekk leer na Yàlla, te yaakaar naa ne leer na leen it, ba ne fàŋŋ. <verse eid="2CO 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 5:12" />Jéemunoo waxati lu ngeen nuy nawe, waaye danu leena bëgga may yoonu tiitaru ci nun, ba am lu ngeen tontoo ñooñuy tiitaroo col gu àndul ak xol. <verse eid="2CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 5:13" />Su fekkee danoo tàggalikoo ak sunu sago, ngir Yàlla la. Su nu àndee ak sunu sago, ngir yéen la. <verse eid="2CO 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 5:14" />Ndaxte mbëggeelu Kirist moo nuy jiite, ndax wóor na nu ne ndegam kenn rekk a dee ngir ñépp, kon ñépp a dee. <verse eid="2CO 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 5:15" />Te dee na ngir ñépp, ngir ñiy dund dootuñu dund ngir seen bopp, waaye ngir ki dee ci seen wàll te dekki.<verse eid="2CO 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 5:16" />Kon nag gannaaw-si-tey xoolatunu kenn ci gis-gisu àddina. Su fekkee mas nanoo xool Kirist ci gis-gisu àddina, léegi xooleetunu ko noonu. <verse eid="2CO 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 5:17" />Kon bu nit bokkee ci Kirist, mbindeef mu bees la. Li jëkk wéy na, lu bees a fi teew. <verse eid="2CO 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 5:18" />Te loolu lépp a ngi sosoo ci Yàlla, mi nu jubale ak boppam jaare ko ci Yeesu Kirist, te sas nu nuy waare juboo googu: <verse eid="2CO 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 5:19" />maanaam, Yàlla jaar na ci Kirist, di jubale waa àddina ak boppam te sëfu leen seeni tooñ. Kàddug juboo googu, Yàlla dénk na nu ko. <verse eid="2CO 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 5:20" />Ay ndaw lanu, yu Kirist yónni, te Yàllaa ngi woo nit ñi jaare ko ci nun. Kon nag ci turu Kirist, nu ngi leen koy ñaan: nanguleena juboo ak Yàlla. <verse eid="2CO 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 5:21" />Kirist mi masula def bàkkaar, Yàlla def na ko bàkkaar ci sunu wàll, ngir ci sunu bokk ci moom, nu mana doon njubteg Yàlla.<verse eid="2CO 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2CO 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 6:1" />Nun nag ñiy liggéeyandoo ak Yàlla, nu ngi leen di ñaan: jariñooleen yiw, wi ngeen jote ci Yàlla, ngir mu baña neen ci yéen. <verse eid="2CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 6:2" />Ndaxte Yàlla nee na:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:2">«Ca jamono ja mu jekke, nangu naa sa ñaan;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:2">ci bésu mucc gi laa la wallu.»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="2CO 6:2">Tey jii la jamono ju jekk ji; tey la bésub mucc gi.<verse eid="2CO 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tiis yi nu daj ci liggéeyal Yàlla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 6:3" />Bëggunoo lëmbaaje xelu kenn ci dara, ngir kenn baña sikk sunu liggéey. <verse eid="2CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 6:4" />Li nu bëgg moo di rafetal sunu tur ni jawriñi Yàlla ci fànn gu nekk; danuy muñ coono yi, tiis yi, njàqare yi; <verse eid="2CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 6:5" />ñu nuy dóor, di nu tëj ci kaso, dëkk yi di yëngu ndax sunu mbir; nuy liggéey ba sonn, di fanaane xool, di woor. <verse eid="2CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 6:6" />Nu ngi rafetal sunu yen ci dund gu sell, ci xam-xam, muñ ak laabiir, ci Xel mu Sell mi ak ci mbëggeel gu raxul njublaŋ, <verse eid="2CO 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 6:7" />ci kàddug dëgg ak ci kàttanu Yàlla, nu ngi yor gànnaayi njubte ci loxol ndijoor ak lu càmmoñ. <verse eid="2CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 6:8" />Ñu bàkk nu, jéppi nu, sant nu, xas nu. Ñu di nu jiiñ réeral, moona niti dëgg lanu. <verse eid="2CO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 6:9" />Ñuy xeeb sunu tur, moona tur yi siiw nañu. Nu mel ni ñu loof, moona nu ngi dund. Ñu yar nu, teewul nu rëcc ci dee. <verse eid="2CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 6:10" />Danuy dékku tiis, waaye di bég fu nu tollu. Nu tumurànke, waaye di woomal ñu bare; amunu dara, fekk noo moom lépp.<verse eid="2CO 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 6:11" />Yéen bokki Korent, wax nanu leen sunu biir ak sunu biti, di leen ubbil sunu xol. <verse eid="2CO 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 6:12" />Ubbiku nanu ci yéen, waaye yéen ubbikuwuleen ci nun. <verse eid="2CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 6:13" />Maa ngi wax ak yéen ni samay doom; feyleen nu bor bi, yéen itam; ubbileen seen xol!<verse eid="2CO 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bàyyileen bokkaale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 6:14" />Buleen likkoo ak ñi gëmul. Gan àndandoo moo mana am diggante njubte ak ndëngte? Gan booloo moo mana am diggante leer ak lëndëm? <verse eid="2CO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 6:15" />Gan déggoo moo mana am diggante Kirist ak Beliyar? Gan jaxasoo moo mana am diggante ki gëm ak ki gëmul? <verse eid="2CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 6:16" />Nan la kër Yàlla mana mànkoo ak xërëm yi? Ndaxte nun nooy kër Yàlla Aji Dund ji, ni ko Yàlla waxe:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:16">«Dinaa dëkk ci seen biir, <optbreak /> tey dox ànd ak ñoom,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:16">ma nekk seen Yàlla, <optbreak /> ñuy samay gaay.»<verse eid="2CO 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 6:17" />Kon nag Boroom bi nee na:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:17">«Génnleen biir ñooñu te beru.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:17">Buleen laal dara lu am sobe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:17">kon dinaa leen teeru.<verse eid="2CO 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 6:18" />Dinaa nekk baay ci yéen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:18">ngeen di doom ci man, muy góor, di jigéen.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:18">Moom la Aji Man ji wax.»<verse eid="2CO 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2CO 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 7:1" />Ndegam nag jot nanu ci dige yu mel nii, samay soppe, nanu sellal sunu bopp ci bépp sobeb yaram walla bu xel, dund dund gu sell, ba mat ci ragal Yàlla.<verse eid="2CO 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbégu Pool ci ñëwug Tit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 7:2" />Yaatal-leen nu ci seen xol. Tooñunu kenn; lorunu kenn; naxunu kenn, jël alalam. <verse eid="2CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 7:3" />Teg leen tooñ taxul may wax lii, ndaxte wax naa ba noppi ne yéena ngi ci sunu xol ci dund ak ci dee. <verse eid="2CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 7:4" />Kóolute gi ma am ci yéen réy na. Tiitar bi may jële ci yéen réy na. Sama xol sedd na guyy. Damaa fees ak mbég ci bépp coono bu nuy daj!<verse eid="2CO 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 7:5" />Ba nu àggee diiwaanu Maseduwan, noppaluwunu, waaye coono bu ne daj nanu ko: xeex ci biti, njàqare ci biir. <verse eid="2CO 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 7:6" />Waaye Yàlla miy dëfal xolu ñiy yoggoorlu ndax tiis, dëfal na sunu xol ci ñëwug Tit, <verse eid="2CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 7:7" />te du ci ñëwam rekk sax waaye ci li ngeen dëfal xolam. Yégal na nu seen nammeel ci nun, seen réccu ak seen farlu jëm ci man, ba sama mbég gën cee yokku.<verse eid="2CO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 7:8" />Su fekkee ne sax, bataaxal bi ma leen bind dafa leen naqare, réccootuma ko. Ci lu jëkk réccu naa ko, ndaxte gis naa ne bataaxal boobu teg na leen tiis, doonte sax ci diir bu néew. <verse eid="2CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 7:9" />Waaye sama xol sedd na léegi, du ndax seen tiis, waaye ci li mu tax ngeen réccu. Tiis wu jóge ci Yàlla ngeen tegoo, te àndul ak benn loraange bu bawoo ci nun. <verse eid="2CO 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 7:10" />Ndaxte tiis wu jóge ci Yàlla dina jur réccu guy jëme ci mucc, te réccu googu laajul gëstu. Waaye tiisu àddina day jëme ci dee. <verse eid="2CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 7:11" />Seen tiis wi jóge ci Yàlla, gisleen nag li mu jur: ndaw njaxlaf ak lay ak mer ak ragal ak nammeel ak farlu, ak bëgga yar ki tooñ! Ci seen jëf yépp wone ngeen ne set ngeen wecc ci mbir moomu. <verse eid="2CO 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 7:12" />Kon nag su ma leen bindee, ki tooñ taxul, ki ñu tooñ it taxul, waaye dama leena bind, ngir ngeen mana gis ci kanam Yàlla cawarte, gi ngeen am ci nun. <verse eid="2CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 7:13" />Te loolu seral na sunu xol.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 7:13">Sunu xel dal na, rawati ci li nu ànd ak Tit ci mbégam, ci li ngeen seral xolam, yéen ñépp. <verse eid="2CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 7:14" />Su fekkee ne tiitaru woon naa ci seen mbir ci kanam Tit, rusuma ci. Dëgg rekk lanu leen masa wax; noonu it la Tit gise ne li nu leen doon seede lépp, dëgg la. <verse eid="2CO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 7:15" />Te mbëggeelam ci yéen gën na yokku, buy fàttaliku ni ngeen ko déggale yéen ñépp, ci li ngeen ko teeru, ànd ak ragal ak weg. <verse eid="2CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 7:16" />Bég naa, ndaxte xam naa ne man naa leena wóolu ci lu nekk!<verse eid="2CO 7:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2CO 8" />
  <para style="s">Mayeleen ak xol yu yéwén</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 8:1" />Gannaaw loolu bokk yi, danu leena bëgga xamal li yiwu Yàlla jur ci biir mboolooy ñi gëm te nekk ci diiwaanu Maseduwan. <verse eid="2CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 8:2" />Nattu yi ñu jaar ëmb nañu coono yu réy; waaye seen mbég mu tar ak seen ñàkk gu metti ñoo jur ci ñoom yéwén gu jéggi dayo. <verse eid="2CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 8:3" />Seede naa ne ñoom ci seen bopp joxe nañu ba fa seen man-man yem, ba weesu ko sax. <verse eid="2CO 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 8:4" />Sarxu nañu nu lool, ngir bokk ci ñiy yónnee ndimbal gaayi Yàlla yi. <verse eid="2CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 8:5" />Te yemuñu sax ci li nu séentu woon ci ñoom, waaye dañoo jébbal seen bopp Boroom bi jëkk, gannaaw loolu ñu jébbal nu seen bopp ci coobarey Yàlla. <verse eid="2CO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 8:6" />Looloo tax nag nu sant Tit, mu ñëw àggale ci yéen, ni mu tàmbalee woon, seen jëfu ndimbal. <verse eid="2CO 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 8:7" />Gannaaw nag wone ngeen cawarte gu tollu noonu, ci ngëm, ci wax, ci xam-xam, ci farlu gu mat, ak ci seen mbëggeel ci nun, sawareleen noonu it ci jëfu ndimbal lii.<verse eid="2CO 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 8:8" />Du ndigal lu ma leen di jox, waaye dama leen di yégal cawarteg ñi ci des, ngir natt fu seen mbëggeel tollu. <verse eid="2CO 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 8:9" />Ndaxte yiwu sunu Boroom Yeesu Kirist umpu leen, ni mu futtee am-amam, ba ñàkk ngir yéen, ndax ngeen woomle cig ñàkkam.<verse eid="2CO 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 8:10" />Kon lii laa xalaat ci lu baax ci yéen: yéen ñi nga xam ne tàmbaliwuleena jëf rekk, waaye yéena jëkka am yéene jii daaw, <verse eid="2CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 8:11" />yeggaleleen ko léegi. Noonu li ngeen mottali ci seen man-man tolloo ak yéene, ji ngeen amoon ci seen mébét. <verse eid="2CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 8:12" />Ndaxte joxe, bu àndee ak yéene, Yàlla dina ko nangu, di seet li nu am te baña seet li nu amul.<verse eid="2CO 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 8:13" />Bëgguma leena teg soxla, ngir woyofal ñi ci des, waaye na ñépp tolloole. <verse eid="2CO 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 8:14" />Tey jii nag man ngeen sàkk ci li ngeen barele, faj soxlay ñeneen, ngir ëllëg it bareleg ñooña faj seen soxla. Noonu ñépp tolloole. <verse eid="2CO 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 8:15" />Moom la Mbind mi tëral ne: «Ki dajale lu bare ëpplewul dara, te ki dajale tuuti ñàkkul.»<verse eid="2CO 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Li tax ñu yónni Tit ak i àndandoom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 8:16" />Cant ñeel na Yàlla, moom mi def ci xolu Tit cawarte gu mel ni sunu gos ci yéen! <verse eid="2CO 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 8:17" />Bi nu ko laajee, mu ñëw ci yéen, nangu na, te rax-ca-dolli cawarteem tollu na, ba nu mana wax ne ci coobarey boppam la jóge, jëm ci yéen. <verse eid="2CO 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 8:18" />Yónniwaale nanu ak moom mbokk, mi am tur wu rafet ci mboolooy ñi gëm ñépp ndax li muy waare xibaaru Kirist. <verse eid="2CO 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 8:19" />Te sax mbooloo yi ñoo ko tànn, ngir mu ànd ak nun, bu nuy yóbbu ndimbal li ngir ndamu Boroom bi, te mu firndeel sunu yéene ju rafet. <verse eid="2CO 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 8:20" />Def nanu noonu nag, ndax kenn bañ noo ŋàññ ci ni nuy topptoo ndimbal lu yaatu loolu. <verse eid="2CO 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 8:21" />Danuy fexee def li jub, du ci kanam Yàlla rekk, waaye it ci kanam nit ñi.<verse eid="2CO 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 8:22" />Yónniwaale nanu it sunu mbokk, mi nu seetlu cawarteem ay yooni yoon ci fànn yu bare, te mu gën koo fésal bii yoon ndax kóolute gu réy, gi mu am ci yéen. <verse eid="2CO 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 8:23" />Noonu kon ci lu jëm ci Tit, sama nawle la ci liggéey, bi ci seen biir. Ci lu jëm ci sunu bokk, yi ànd ak moom nag, ndawi mbooloom ñi gëm lañu, ñuy wone ndamu Kirist. <verse eid="2CO 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 8:24" />Na seen teeru firndeel nag seen mbëggeel ci kanam mboolooy ñi gëm, te dëggal leen ne noo yey wóolu leen.<verse eid="2CO 8:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2CO 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 9:1" />Ci mbirum ndimbal loolu jëm ci gaayi Yàlla yi, matul ma leen di bindaat, <verse eid="2CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 9:2" />ndaxte xam naa seen yéene ju rafet, te maa ngi ciy damu ci kanam waa Maseduwan, naan leen: «Daaw fekk na waa Akayi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.2 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">waa Akayi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Korent mooy péeyu diiwaanu Akayi.</char></note> jekk.» Te seen cawarte xamb na ñu bare ci ñoom. <verse eid="2CO 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 9:3" />Maa ngi yónni nag bokk yooyu, ngir damu gi nu doon damu ci yéen ci mbir mii baña neen, te ngeen jekk, ni ma ko waxe woon. <verse eid="2CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 9:4" />Danoo bañ rekk waa Maseduwan, ñiy ànd ak man, fekk jekkaguleen; te kon kóolute googu nu am ci yéen dina nekk sunu gàcce, waxaalewuma nag seen bos. <verse eid="2CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 9:5" />Moo tax ma xalaat ne li gën mooy yónni bokk yooyu, ñu jiitu ma ci yéen, topptoo mbiri ndimbal lu yaatu loolu ngeen dige woon. Loolu di may gu tàlli, te baña nekk yëfi nay.<verse eid="2CO 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ku ji lu bare, góob lu bare</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 9:6" />Li am mooy: ku ji tuuti, góob tuuti; ku ji lu bare, góob lu bare. <verse eid="2CO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 9:7" />Kon na ku nekk joxe, ni mu ko nase ci xolam, te bañ cee am réccu walla sañul-bañ, ndaxte kiy joxe ak mbég moo neex Boroom bi. <verse eid="2CO 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 9:8" />Yàlla man na leena woomal ci bépp yiwam ba ci fépp ak ci lépp, ngeen faj seen soxla yépp te sakkanle it ngir bépp jëf bu baax. <verse eid="2CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 9:9" />Moom la Mbind mi wax ne:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 9:9">«Tabe na, ba may baadoolo yi;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 9:9">njubteem day sax ba fàww.»<verse eid="2CO 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 9:10" />Yàlla miy jox beykat bi jiwu ak nit ab dund, dina leen jox jiwu wu ne gàññ, te sakkanal li seen njub meññ. <verse eid="2CO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 9:11" />Noonu dingeen woomle ci lépp, ba yéwén ci bépp anam, ba tax ñu bare gërëm Yàlla ndax li ngeen maye jaarale ko ci nun.<verse eid="2CO 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 9:12" />Ndaxte njaamu, gi ngeen di jaamu, yemul rekk ci faj soxlay gaayi Yàlla yi, waaye dina tax it ngërëmu ñu bare baawaan, jëm ci Yàlla. <verse eid="2CO 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 9:13" />Ci li ngeen firndeel seen mbëggeel ci joxe ndimbal lii, dinañu màggal Yàlla, ndaxte wone ngeen ni ngeen déggale xibaaru jàmm bu Kirist bi, ak ni ngeen yéwéne ci seen ndimbal jëme ci ñoom ak ñépp. <verse eid="2CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 9:14" />Rax-ca-dolli dinañu sant Yàlla ak xol bu fees ak cofeel ci yéen ndax yiw wu mag, wi Yàlla def ci yéen. <verse eid="2CO 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 9:15" />Jërëjëfati yaw Yàlla ndax sa may googu weesu dayo!<verse eid="2CO 9:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2CO 10" />
  <para style="s">Pool ñaan na, ñu nangu sañ-sañam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="2CO 10:1-2" />Ci lu jëm ci samay mbir nag, maa ngi leen di ñaan-- man Pool, mi ñu ne, ci seen biir «ragal» laa, bu ma leen soree, «ñeme»-- maa ngi leen di ñaan ndax woyof ak lewetaayu Kirist, ngir bu ma ñëwee, ma baña ànd ak ñeme gi may dencal ñenn ñiy xalaat ne gis-gisu nit lanu topp. <verse eid="2CO 10:1-2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 10:3" />Dëgg la ne nit rekk lanu, waaye dunu xeexe ni nit. <verse eid="2CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 10:4" />Ndaxte gànnaay, yi nuy xaree, jógewuñu ci nit, waaye ca Yàlla lañu jóge, te ànd ak kàttan, ngir daaneel ay tata. Danuy daaneel xalaat yi dul dëgg <verse eid="2CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 10:5" />ak bépp tiitar buy jànkoonteek xam-xamu Yàlla, te danuy not bépp xalaat, ba mu déggal Kirist. <verse eid="2CO 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 10:6" />Te fas yéene nanoo jubbanti képp ku déggadi, bés bu seen dégg ndigal matee.<verse eid="2CO 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 10:7" />Xool-leen mbir mi ne fàŋŋ. Bu amee ku mu wóor ne ci Kirist la bokk, na jàpp it ne su bokkee ci Kirist, nun itam ci Kirist lanu bokk. <verse eid="2CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 10:8" />Awma lu may rus, su may damu lu ëpp ci sañ-sañ bi nu Boroom bi jox, di sañ-sañu yokk seen ngëm, te du ngir seen kasara. <verse eid="2CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 10:9" />Ba tey bëgguma ngeen xalaat ne maa ngi leen di xëbal ci samay bataaxal. <verse eid="2CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 10:10" />Ndaxte am na ku naan: «Ay bataaxalam dañoo ñagas te am doole, waaye bu teewee dafay ñàkk fulla, di wax waxi picc.» <verse eid="2CO 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 10:11" />Kiy wax loolu na xam lii: ni sunuy kàddu mel ci sunuy bataaxal, bu nu fa nekkul, noonu it lanuy mel ci sunuy jëf, bu nu teewee.<verse eid="2CO 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 10:12" />Ñemewunoo féetale walla méngale sunu bopp ak ñooñu naw seen bopp. Ci li ñuy sàkk ab natt ngir natt ak méngale seen bopp ak seen bopp, ñàkk xel a tax. <verse eid="2CO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 10:13" />Nun nag dunu damu ci lu weesu dayo. Nu ngi damu ci liggéey bi nu Yàlla sas, ba may nu, nu agsi ci yéen. <verse eid="2CO 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 10:14" />Bu sunu sas agsiwul woon ba ci yéen, kon man nanoo ne génn nanu sas wi nu Yàlla sas. Waaye agsi na ba ci yéen, te indil nanu leen xibaaru jàmm bi jëm ci Kirist. <verse eid="2CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 10:15" />Kon nag dunu jéggi dig yi Yàlla rëdd, bay damu ci liggéeyu ñeneen. Waaye am nanu yaakaar ne su seen ngëm yokkoo, dinanu gëna màgg ci seen biir, des ba tey ci dig yi nu Yàlla rëddal. <verse eid="2CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 10:16" />Noonu dinanu mana yégle xibaaru jàmm bi ci bérab, yi leen féete gannaaw, te baña damu ci li ñeneen ñi def ci seen sas. <verse eid="2CO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 10:17" />Waaye ni ko Mbind mi waxe: «Kuy damu, na damu ci Boroom bi.»<verse eid="2CO 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 10:18" />Ndaxte ki neex Yàlla, du ki naw boppam, waaye ki Yàlla gërëm.<verse eid="2CO 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2CO 11" />
  <para style="s">Pool ak ndawi naaféq yi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 11:1" />Céy bu ngeen ma manoona muñal, ma wax leen tuuti waxi dof! Waaw, muñal-leen ma sax. <verse eid="2CO 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 11:2" />Dama leen di fiire ak fiiraange gu jóge ca Yàlla, ndaxte dama leena bëgga jébbal jenn jëkkër kepp, muy Kirist, ngeen set ni janq. <verse eid="2CO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 11:3" />Waaye ni jaan ja naxe woon Awa ci pexeem, ragal naa yéen itam ñu lëmbaaje ni seen xel, ba ngeen dëddu xol bu laab, bi ngeen amoon ci seen diggante ak Kirist. <verse eid="2CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 11:4" />Ndaxte bu kenn ñëwee, di leen waar ci Yeesu ci lu juuyoo ak li nu leen yégal, walla ngeen jot meneen xel mu wuute ak Xel mi ngeen jot, walla ngeen nangu beneen xibaar bu wuute ak bi ngeen dégg, dingeen ko dékku bu baax. <verse eid="2CO 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 11:5" />Moona foog naa ne seen ndaw yooyu ngeen yékkati, ba ñu ëpp ndaw sax, ëpplewuñu ma dara. <verse eid="2CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 11:6" />Bu ma dul jàmbaari wax it, néewuma xam-xam, te won nanu leen ko ci bépp mbir ak ci bépp fànn.<verse eid="2CO 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 11:7" />Walla boog ndax dama leena tooñ ci li ma suufeel sama bopp ngir yékkati leen, ba ma leen di yégal xibaaru jàmm bi te laajuma leen genn pey? <verse eid="2CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 11:8" />Xanaa kay damaa tooñ ci li ma dunde alalu yeneen mboolooy ñi gëm, ba futti leen, ngir dimbali leen, yéen. <verse eid="2CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 11:9" />Te ba ma nekkee ci yéen te soxla dab ma, wéeruwuma ci kenn ci yéen, ndaxte bokk ya jóge Maseduwan ñoo ma indil li ma soxla woon. Ci lépp moytu naa nekk yen ci yéen, te dinaa ko gëna def. <verse eid="2CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 11:10" />Ni mu wóore ne dëggug Kirist nekk na ci man, ni la wóore ne loolii may damoo, kenn du ko teggi ci diiwaanu Akayi gépp. <verse eid="2CO 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 11:11" />Lu tax? Ndax dama leena bëggul? Yàlla xam na ne bëgg naa leen! <verse eid="2CO 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 11:12" />Noonu may doxale nag dinaa ci sax, ngir ñiy damu, di wut yoon wu ñu aw ba yemale seen bopp ak nun, duñu ko am. <verse eid="2CO 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 11:13" />Ay ndawi naaféq lañu, di ay liggéeykat yu njublaŋ yuy mbubboo turu ndawi Kirist. <verse eid="2CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 11:14" />Te loolu jaaxalu nu, ndaxte Seytaane moom ci boppam day mbubboo malaakam leer. <verse eid="2CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 11:15" />Kon nag ay ndawam mbubboo ndawi njub, loolu du nu jaaxal. Dees na leen fey seeni jëf.<verse eid="2CO 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nattuy Pool ci matal yónnentam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 11:16" />Maa ngi leen koy waxaat: bu ma kenn jàpp nib dof. Walla boog bu ngeen ma ko jàppee, séddleen ma céru dof, ngir ma damu tuuti, man itam. <verse eid="2CO 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 11:17" />Loolu may wax nag, waxuma ko ci turu Boroom bi. Bu ma ñemee damoo nii, maa ngi wax ni dof. <verse eid="2CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 11:18" />Ndegam ñu bare dañuy damu ni nit kese, man itam kon dinaa damu. <verse eid="2CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 11:19" />Yéen boroom xel yi, aka ngeena mana muñal ñi dof, <verse eid="2CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 11:20" />nde yéena ngi muñ ñi leen di jaamloo, di lekk seen alal, di leen nax, di leen xeeb, di leen talaata! <verse eid="2CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 11:21" />Sunu néew doole mayu nu, nu dem ba jëfe noonu; rus naa ci lool de!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 11:21">Ma wax waxi dof; moona lépp lu waay ñemee damoo, ñeme naa ko, man it. <verse eid="2CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 11:22" />Ndax Ebrë lañu? Man it Ebrë laa. Ndax bànni Israyil lañu? Man itam ci laa. Ndax sëti Ibraayma lañu? Man itam moom laa. <verse eid="2CO 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 11:23" />Ndax surgay Kirist lañu? --maa ngi wax waxi ku tàggoo ak sagoom nag-- maa leen ko gëna doon. Bu dee ci liggéey, maa leen ci man. Bu dee ci li ñu nu tëj ci kaso, maa leen ko gëna miin. Bu dee ci li ñu nu dóor ay yar, maa leen ëpple. Leru naa dee ba tàyyi. <verse eid="2CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 11:24" />Juróomi yoon Yawut yi dóor nañu ma fanweeri yar ak juróom ñeent. <verse eid="2CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CO 11:25" />Ñetti yoon dóorees na ma ay yet, te mas nañu maa sànni ay xeer, bëgg maa rey. Ñetti yoon dugg naa gaal, mu suux. Mas naa yendu ci ndox, fanaan ci. <verse eid="2CO 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CO 11:26" />Ci sama tukki yu bare yi daan naa faral di daje ak musiba ci dex yi, ak musiba ci sàcc yi, musiba mu jóge ci sama xeet walla ci ñi dul Yawut, musiba ci biir dëkk yi, ci màndiŋ yi, ci géej gi, ci biir bokki taalibe yu naaféq yi. <verse eid="2CO 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CO 11:27" />Sonn naa, di ñaq, di fanaane xool, di xiif ak a mar tey fande, di dékku liw te rafle, <verse eid="2CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CO 11:28" />waxaalewuma li ci des nag: bés bu nekk maa ngi xalaat mboolooy ñi gëm. <verse eid="2CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CO 11:29" />Ana ku ci néew doole, te wàlluma ko? Ana ku ci bàkkaar, te awma naqar wu tiis?<verse eid="2CO 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CO 11:30" />Su ma damu waree kon, ci sama néew doole laay damoo. <verse eid="2CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CO 11:31" />Yàlla Baayu sunu Boroom Yeesu, moom mi màgg ba fàww, xam na ne du ay fen ci man. <verse eid="2CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CO 11:32" />Ba ma nekkee dëkku Damaas, boroom dëkk ba, di jawriñu buur ba Aretas, dafa santaane woon ñuy wottu dëkk ba, ngir man maa jàpp. <verse eid="2CO 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CO 11:33" />Waaye dugalees na ma ci dàmba, jaarale ma ci palanteeru miiri dëkk ba, yoor ma ci suuf. Noonu ma rëcc ko.<verse eid="2CO 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2CO 12" />
  <para style="s">Peeñub Pool ak nattu bi ko dal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 12:1" />Damu amul njariñ, ba tey war na ma. Kon ma jàll ci nettali gis-gisi Boroom bi ak i peeñu. <verse eid="2CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 12:2" />Xam naa taalibeb Kirist boo xam ne yékkati nañu ko ba ca asamaan, si gëna kawe, booba ak léegi mat na fukki at ak ñeent. Xawma ndax ànd na ak jëmmam walla déet. Yàlla rekk a xam. <verse eid="2CO 12:2" /><verse number="3-4" style="v" sid="2CO 12:3-4" />Xam naa ne, nit kooku yékkati nañu ko ba fa Yàlla nekk. Bu dee ci jëmmam mbaa ci xelam, xawma; Yàllaa xam. Mu dégg fa baat yu ñu manula nettali te yu ñu mayul doom Aadama, mu ŋaaŋ ko. <verse eid="2CO 12:3-4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 12:5" />Dinaa damu ci nit ku mel noonu. Waaye duma damu ci sama bopp, lu dul liy wone sama néew doole. <verse eid="2CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 12:6" />Su ma bëggoona damu, du doon yëfi dof, ndaxte dëgg laay wax. Waaye damay moytoo damu, ngir kenn baña foog ci man lu weesu li mu gis, may def, te muy dégg, ma di ko wax.<verse eid="2CO 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 12:7" />Te it ngir ma baña yég sama bopp ndax peeñu yooyu wees xel, mayees na mbir dal ma ci sama yaram, di ma mitital ni dég, muy malaakam Seytaane mu may sonal, ngir ma baña yég sama bopp. <verse eid="2CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 12:8" />Ñaan naa Boroom bi ñetti yoon ci mbir moomu, ngir mu teqale ma ak moom. <verse eid="2CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 12:9" />Mu ne ma: «Sama yiw doy na la; sama kàttan a ngi mate cig néew doole.» Kon nag dëgg-dëgg, gën na maa bég ci damu ndax sama néew doole, ngir kàttanu Kirist dëkk ci man. <verse eid="2CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 12:10" />Looloo tax may bég ci néew doole, yi may wéye ngir turu Kirist, ciy tiis, ciy njàqare, mbaa ñu saaga ma, mbaa ñu fitnaal ma. Ndaxte bu ma néewee doole, booba laay am kàttan.<verse eid="2CO 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pool bëgg na leen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 12:11" />Ci dëgg-dëgg wax naa waxi dof te yéena ma ci dugal, fekk yéen ci seen bopp sax yéena ma waroona sargal, ndaxte su ma dul dara sax, seen ndaw yooyu ngeen naw ëpplewuñu ma dara. <verse eid="2CO 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 12:12" />Kéemaan yi, jaloore yi ak jëf yu màgg, yiy firndeel ndawul Kirist, feeñ nañu ci seen biir, ma ànd ci ak muñ gu mat. <verse eid="2CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 12:13" />Lan laa defal yeneen mboolooy ñi gëm te defaluma leen ko, xanaa rekk li ma wéeru ci ñoom te wéeruwuma ci yéen? Baal-leen ma googu tooñ!<verse eid="2CO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 12:14" />Maa ngi leen di waaja ganesi ñetteel bi yoon, te duma wéeru ci yéen. Wutsiwuma seen alal, yéen laa soxla. Ndaxte du gone moo wara yor waajuram, waaye waajur moo wara yor gone yi. <verse eid="2CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 12:15" />Man nag nangu naa joxe li ma am lépp ak xol bu sedd, ba joxe sama bopp sax, ngir dimbali leen. Gannaaw bëgg naa leen nii, xanaa kay seen mbëggeel ci man warula wàññiku? <verse eid="2CO 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 12:16" />Kon noonu la, nekkuma woon yen ci yéen. Waaye man na am ñu naan, dama leena nax, ba réeral leen ci sama njublaŋ.<verse eid="2CO 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 12:17" />Ndax damaa lekk seen alal, jaare ko ci kenn ci ñi ma yónni woon? <verse eid="2CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 12:18" />Sant naa Tit, mu ñëw ci yéen, te yebal naa sunu mbokk moomu ak moom. Ndax Tit dafa lekk seen alal? Man ak moom, ndax bokkunu woon xel mu nu yékkati ak tànk yu nuy dox?<verse eid="2CO 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 12:19" />Xanaa diirub li ngeen di jàng lii, defe ngeen ne nu ngi wut aw lay ci seen kanam. Samay xarit, nu ngi leen di wax ci kanam Yàlla ak ci turu Kirist; te lépp ngir seen njariñ la. <verse eid="2CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 12:20" />Ragal naa, bu ma ñëwee ci yéen, fekk leen nu ma neexul, te yéen it ngeen fekk ma nu leen neexul. Ragal naa fekk ay xuloo ci seen biir, ak ñeetaane, xadar ak diiroo mbagg, xas ak jëw, réy-réylu ak yëngu-yëngu. <verse eid="2CO 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 12:21" />Ragal naa, bu ma leen ganesiwaatee, Yàlla sama Boroom suufeel ma ci seen biir, ma naqarlu ci ñu bare ñu bàkkaaroon te dëdduwuñu seen yàqute, seen njaaloo ak seen ñaawteef, gi ñu doon def.<verse eid="2CO 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2CO 13" />
  <para style="s">Artu yu mujj yi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 13:1" />Bii mooy ñetteel bi yoon, ma di leen ganesi. «Bépp àtte dina aju ci seedes ñaar walla ñetti nit.» <verse eid="2CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 13:2" />Li ma waxoon ci sama ñaareelu ngan, ci ñi bàkkaaroon bu yàgg ak ñi ci des, maa ngi koy waxaat léegi, bala maa dikkaat: su ma délsee, duma yërëm kenn. <verse eid="2CO 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 13:3" />Bu fekkee ne dangeena bëgg firnde juy wone ne Kirist mooy wax jaarale ko ci man, dingeen ko am. Digganteem ak yéen du ànd ak néew doole, waaye dafay feeñal kàttan ci seen biir. <verse eid="2CO 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 13:4" />Néewoon na doole, ba ñu koy daaj ca bant ngir rey ko, waaye mi ngi dund ci kàttanu Yàlla. Nun itam néew nanu doole ci sunu bokk ci moom, waaye dinanu dund ak moom ci kàttanu Yàlla, bu nuy jëfante ak yéen.<verse eid="2CO 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 13:5" />Xool-leen seen bopp bu baax, ba xam ndax ngëm a ngi ci yéen. Seetluleen seen bopp. Xanaa xamuleen ne Yeesoo ngi ci yéen? Walla boog ngeen gis ne ay naaféq ngeen. <verse eid="2CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 13:6" />Waaye yaakaar naa ne dingeen gis ne man nanoo wone nun, firndeg ngëm. <verse eid="2CO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 13:7" />Nu ngi ñaan Yàlla, ngeen baña def dara lu bon. Waxuma ne danoo bëgga wone noonu sunu firndeg ngëm, waaye sunu yéene mooy ngeen jëf lu baax, boo yaboo sax ñu jiiñ nu ag naaféq. <verse eid="2CO 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 13:8" />Ndaxte manalunu dara dëggu Yàlla gi; manunu lu dul taxawal ko. <verse eid="2CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 13:9" />Bu nu néewee doole, fekk am ngeen doole, bég nanu ci. Te sax nu ngi ñaan, ngeen jublu cig mat. <verse eid="2CO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 13:10" />Looloo tax ma leen di binde nii, bala maa ñëw; bëgguma leena duma ci sañ-sañ bi ma Boroom bi jox. Jox na ma ko, ngir ma yokk seen ngëm, waaye du ngir seen kasara.<verse eid="2CO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tàggtoo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 13:11" />Kon nag bokk yi, bégleen, jublu cig mat, di déglu soññante bi ma leen di dénk, am benn xalaat te dëkk ci jàmm; noonu Yàlla miy mbëggeel te di Yàllay jàmm dina ànd ak yéen.<verse eid="2CO 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 13:12" />Saafoonteleen ak xol bu laab. Mboolem gaayi Yàlla yépp ñu ngi leen di nuyu.<verse eid="2CO 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 13:13" />Yal na yiwu sunu Boroom Yeesu Kirist, ak mbëggeelu Yàlla ak booloo, gi nu am ak Xel mu Sell mi, ànd ak yéen ñépp.<verse eid="2CO 13:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 13" />
</usx>